# Line endings are not cosmetic in this project. A state identifier is the hash
# of the bytes of its file, and anything that rewrites newlines in transit
# breaks verification everywhere downstream.
#
# Everything is LF, including JSON. Marking JSON binary was the first attempt
# and was worse: it left the file however the checkout happened to write it, so
# a Windows working tree and a Linux one held different bytes for the vector
# file that exists to prove two implementations agree.
*           text=auto eol=lf
*.json      text eol=lf
*.ts        text eol=lf
*.tsx       text eol=lf
